        "text_hB4pRR": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p><strong>Rebel Nell's necklaces are made from repurposed graffiti, others from fragments of iconic landmarks, fan-favorite sports collaborations, or college campus rocks, so every necklace stands on its own</strong>. That mix of style and meaning is what turns our necklace gifts into something more than jewelry, whether you're picking one out for yourself or for someone who deserves a piece they won't see on anyone else. Browse the rest of our <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/products\" title=\"shop all jewelry\">unique jewelry collection</a> for more reclaimed pieces with the same craft behind them.</p><p><strong>Rebel Nell was founded in Detroit in 2013 to give every piece we make a deeper purpose. </strong>Our Creative Designers, women employed through our workforce program, are the hands behind every necklace, so each one carries the history of its material and a story of opportunity right along with it. You can read <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/our-story\" title=\"read rebel nell's story\">Rebel Nell's story</a> and our <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/reviews-1\" title=\"read our reviews\">customer reviews</a>. </p>"
          }
        }
